    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAs">III As</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Secundum est de pace nostra, quam omnis populus teneri desiderat, sicut apud Greateleyam sapientes tui posuerunt, et sicut etiam nunc dictum est in concilio apud Favresham.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The second relates to the measures enacted by your councillors at Grately, and now also proclaimed in the Council at Faversham, for the peace of our land, for the preservation of which the whole people is much concerned.</ab>
      </div>
